# Investor Timeline for Benchmark Dataset Public Release

**Author:** Julia Rodriguez  
**Date:** 2026-03-28  
**File Path:** data/finance/investor_timeline_request_2026-03-28.xlsx

---

## Executive Summary
This document outlines a detailed timeline for the public release of the benchmark dataset, addressing urgent investor requests for clarity on product milestones and associated financial projections. The timeline integrates technical, operational, and strategic considerations, balancing innovation with risk management. Recent challenges, including engineering bottlenecks, employee burnout, and resource allocation debates, are factored into the proposed timeline.

